flowchart TD
    subgraph Clients["Clients"]
        WebUser["Web Console"]
        CodingAgent["Coding Agent<br/>MCP / Skill"]
        CLIUser["CLI / CI"]
    end

    subgraph Server["Tern Server :7430"]
        RestAPI["REST API"]
        WSGateway["WebSocket Gateway"]
        SyncEngine["Case Syncer"]
        Scheduler["Run Scheduler"]
        DB[("SQLite / MySQL / PostgreSQL")]
        ArtifactStore["Artifacts<br/>Local Disk"]
    end

    subgraph Workers["Worker Pool"]
        Worker1["Worker #1<br/>Playwright + slots"]
        WorkerN["Worker #N<br/>Playwright + slots"]
    end

    CaseRepo[("Git Case Repos<br/>cases/**/*.spec.ts")]

    WebUser -->|HTTP / WS| Server
    CodingAgent -->|MCP| Server
    CLIUser -->|REST| Server

    SyncEngine --> CaseRepo
    SyncEngine --> DB
    Scheduler --> DB
    Scheduler --> WSGateway
    RestAPI --> Scheduler

    WSGateway <-->|outbound WS| Worker1
    WSGateway <-->|outbound WS| WorkerN
    Worker1 -->|screenshots / traces| ArtifactStore
    WorkerN -->|screenshots / traces| ArtifactStore
